# Alembic

Run from `backend/` with `DATABASE_URL` configured:

```bash
alembic upgrade head
alembic downgrade base
alembic current
```

The baseline creates the `sthalo` and `extensions` schemas and installs
PostGIS, `btree_gist`, and `pgcrypto` into `extensions`. The downgrade preserves
shared schemas/extensions because Supabase-managed services may depend on them.
